{"title":"Sea Witch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 17 Pirate that attacks with slash (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>4</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/pirate-sea-witch\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 2 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 65 total, 65 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×65</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"oak-longbow\" title=\"Oak Longbow - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/38f5706b16dfda53ae8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Oak Longbow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"scroll-ice-grasp\" title=\"Scroll Ice Grasp - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/89f9dc0356926f71c73f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Ice Grasp</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackalhide-feet\" title=\"Jackalhide Feet - in 1 of 2 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/072e3c5594bfe366d41c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackalhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/mother-brack-the-sea-witch\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/8193c37ec86184d63047.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Mother Brack, the Sea Witch</b><span>Lv 17–21</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Pirate: <a href=\"#/monster/pirate\">Pirate</a> <span class=\"muted\">(9)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-bosun\">Pirate Bosun</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-marksman\">Pirate Marksman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(18)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-captain\">Pirate Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/a6ef9f6da6635d98bdce.svg\" alt=\"Sea Witch\"></div><h3>Sea Witch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>21</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 17)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Pirate</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>70</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>16.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>2 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}